## Gates
$ node scripts/verify-dist-fresh.ts        -> 31/31 targets fresh (the plugin is inlined by nothing: 0 dependents stale)
$ node scripts/verify-comment-coverage.ts  -> VERDICT: PASS
$ node scripts/verify-docs-parity.ts       -> bilingual pair updated in BOTH languages

## How the user toggles each page (row config, restart-scoped)
- id: mpd-tui
  config:
    panel: false        # the MPD page off
    workmate: false     # the workmate page off
A page that is NEVER REGISTERED cannot be re-added by the host's config re-apply or by MPD's
enable keeper, which is why this switch sticks.
